# Routine "Event countdown check": the template does not carry a machine-readable schedule
# (Grok Bot sets it when the routine is created/enabled).
# Cadence described in the template: Every weekday morning, what is due, what is late, and what is still unconfirmed, with the days-out count, registrations against target, and the guest gaps that get expensive late.
# Fill in the five cron fields, then add to crontab -e:
# M H DOM MON DOW cd /path/to/event-producer && pi -p "/event-countdown-check"
